{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p066d","title":"桓范劝许允入见阮氏阮氏论德许允惭而敬之","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p066d-account","label":"《魏氏春秋》","text":"桓范劝许允入见阮氏阮氏论德许允惭而敬之","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p066d-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0030","role":"劝和","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p066d-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0069","role":"敬妻","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p066d-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0120","role":"论德","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p066d-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"许允仕明帝至死后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p066d-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-p066d-q","source_order":[9,638,"P066d"],"order":2374}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0030","name":"桓范","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0069","name":"许允","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xiahoucao-p0120","name":"阮氏（许允妻）","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p066d-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-b3fb00b23d11cf366efe","layer":"pei","quote":"允妻阮氏，贤明而丑，允始见愕然；交礼毕，无复入意。妻遣婢觇之，云：‘有客姓桓。’妻曰：‘是必桓范，将劝使入也。’既而范果劝之。允入，须臾便起，妻捉裾留之。允顾谓妇曰：‘妇有四德，卿有其几？’妇曰：‘新妇所乏唯容。士有百行，君有其几？’（许）〔允〕曰：‘皆备！’妇曰：‘士有百行，以德为首。君好色不好德，何谓皆备？’允有惭色，知其非凡，遂雅相亲重。","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":637,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0f3b23485549690803dc","start":356,"end":529,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
